            "detailed_description": "Into Blue Valley is a first-person short exploration game drawing upon themes of mystery and curiosity. It is presented as a 'found footage' game with the player's view resembling a camcorder recording showing a glimpse into the subdued environment that is being explored.<br><br>As the footage unfolds, it soon becomes clear that the bittersweet majesty of Blue Valley offers more than a forgotten tale of abandonment and that the person recording this footage is not alone in their journey.<br><br>Successfully Greenlit by the wonderful Steam community in just three weeks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><br>WASD to move.<br>Mouse for camera input.<br>Left click to interact.",
